    "# Building 4 and Building 6: Monthly Electricity Forecasting\n",
    "\n",
    "Train on pre-month history, select models using June–September 2020, and predict October and November on 15-minute UTC grids (2,976 and 2,880 points).\n",
    "\n",
    "## 1. Data and features\n",
    "Load the original TSF snapshots and ERA5 weather. Build Melbourne calendar features and 35-day-lagged building/solar features. Repeat hourly predictions across four 15-minute intervals.\n",
    "\n",
    "**Evaluation:** Historical backtest with observed weather, not a new blind test. Score observed targets only; do not fill missing targets. Incomplete historical features fall back to the calendar/weather model. MASE uses the pre-month 2,688-step seasonal scale; R² is not percentage accuracy."
